Implemented the mushroom jump pad behavior.

Changed:
- `jumping_pad/jumping_pad.gd`
  - Player-only `body_entered` trigger.
  - Deterministic launch velocity along the pad’s local surface normal using `global_transform.basis.y`.
  - Strong exported launch speed of `28.0`, much higher than the player’s normal jump.
  - Restarts a squash/rebound tween on each valid player contact.
  - Finds the highest mesh under the mushroom model at runtime to target the cap when possible, with fallback to the mushroom root.

- `player/player.gd`
  - Added `launch_from_jump_pad(launch_velocity)` to replace existing momentum and trigger the jump animation.

Verified:
- Ran `res://playground.tscn` through the Godot MCP runner.
- Godot reported no runtime or parser errors.

Note:
- Existing untracked files like `.claude/`, `.gemini/`, `.mcp.json`, and `opencode.json` were left untouched.
